{'symbol': 'LH', 'date': '2021-12-03 12:34:00', 'title': 'LABCORP COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF TOXIKON CORPORATION', 'text': "BURLINGTON, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LABCORP (NYSE: LH), A LEADING GLOBAL LIFE SCIENCES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CLOSED ITS ACQUISITION OF TOXIKON CORPORATION, A CONTRACT RESEARCH ORGANIZATION DELIVERING BEST-IN-CLASS NONCLINICAL TESTING SERVICES. THE ADDITION OF TOXIKON TO LABCORP DRUG DEVELOPMENT BOLSTERS LABCORP'S STRONG NONCLINICAL DEVELOPMENT PORTFOLIO, AND CREATES A STRATEGIC FOOTPRINT FOR THE COMPANY TO PARTNER WITH PHARMACEUTICAL AND BIOTECHNOLOGY CLIENTS IN THE BOSTON, MASS.,"}